@startuml
title Figure 2. End-to-End Business Process Activity Diagram across Bounded Contexts - Erasmus Mobility Platform (EMP)
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName "Helvetica", "Arial", sans-serif
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam roundCorner 12

skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #FFF8EE
  BorderColor #8D5B4C
  FontColor #000000
  FontSize 12
  ArrowColor #333333
  ArrowFontSize 11
  ArrowFontStyle bold
}

skinparam diamond {
  BackgroundColor #FFF2DF
  BorderColor #8D5B4C
  FontSize 11
}

skinparam partition {
  BorderColor #555555
  BorderThickness 1.5
  BackgroundColor #FAFAFA
  FontSize 13
  FontStyle bold
}

skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #FEFFDD
  BorderColor #C4B94C
  FontSize 10
}

|#EFF6FF|Mobility Preparation (Supporting)|
|#FFF7ED|Equivalence Management (Supporting)|
|#F0FDF4|Learning Agreement Management (Core Domain)|

|Mobility Preparation (Supporting)|
start
:Confirm Student Nomination;
:Generate Administrative Checklist;

note right
  AcceptEventAction without incoming flow:
  active as long as mobility preparation is active.
  The interrupting edge leaves the region,
  aborts all parallel tokens, and initiates
  cascading cancellation and grant fund release.
end note

group #FEF9F5 <<interruptible activity region>>

fork
  |Mobility Preparation (Supporting)|
  :Complete Health & Linguistic Tasks\n(EHIC Card, OLS Assessment);
  :Sign Erasmus+ Grant Agreement\n(Monthly Financial Scholarship);
  :Upload Supporting Documents\n(Private Insurance, Official Acceptance);
  :Monitor Checklist Progress & Deadlines;

fork again
  |Equivalence Management (Supporting)|
  :Search Course Equivalences in Catalog;
  if (Equivalence found in catalog?) then ([No: New Course])
    :Propose New Equivalence by Student;
    :Evaluate Course Syllabus & Learning Outcomes;
    :Register & Validate ECTS Parity;
  else ([Yes: In Catalog])
    :Select Pre-Approved Course Mappings;
  endif

  |Learning Agreement Management (Core Domain)|
  :Create Draft Learning Agreement;
  repeat
    :Manage Course Lines (Table A & Table B);
    :Validate ECTS Credit Balance;
    if (ECTS Invariant Satisfied (Σ A == Σ B >= 30)?) then ([Yes: Invariant Valid])
      :Submit Learning Agreement;
      break
    else ([No: Credit Deficit])
      :Adjust Course Lines;
    endif
  repeat while (Retry Validation)

  :Conduct Home Academic Coordinator Review;
  if (Coordinator Decision?) then ([Approved])
    :Approve Contract (Status: APPROVED_BY_FACULTY);
    :Transmit via EWP Network & Sign at Host Partner;
    :Emit LearningAgreementApprovedEvent (Outbox);
    |Mobility Preparation (Supporting)|
    :Mark "Learning Agreement" Task Completed;
  else ([Changes Requested])
    :Request Amendment (Status: UNDER_REVIEW);
    :Notify Student & Return for Revision;
    stop
  endif

end fork

end group

|Mobility Preparation (Supporting)|
:Validate Complete Mobility Dossier & Issue Departure Certificate;
:Finalize Mobility Preparation Phase;
:Publish MobilityPreparedEvent;
:Activate "Student Abroad" Academic Status;
stop

' Cancellation Flow (Interrupting Edge)
|Learning Agreement Management (Core Domain)|
floating note
  ⚡ <<interrupting edge>>
  Triggered on: Receive Mobility Cancellation Request
  (Student Withdrawal / Force Majeure Signal)
end note

:Cancel Mobility Dossier (Status: CANCELLED);
:Cascade Cancel Learning Agreement (Status: CANCELLED);
:Abort Active Checklist Tasks (Freeze Document Uploads);
:Publish MobilityCancelledEvent (Notify Host Partner);
:Deallocate Erasmus Grant Funds & DRI Reconciliation;
stop

@enduml
